# Environment
.env*

# Claude Code local settings — everything is local EXCEPT the release pair:
# the release-engineer agent definition (docs/agents/release-runbook.md declares
# itself the source of truth for it) and the /ship command that invokes it. All
# three must travel together or a fresh clone gets a runbook with no agent, or an
# agent with no way to launch it.
# Note the `dir/*` form: git cannot re-include a file whose parent dir is excluded.
.claude/*
!.claude/agents/
.claude/agents/*
!.claude/agents/release-engineer.md
!.claude/commands/
.claude/commands/*
!.claude/commands/ship.md

# Financial data (sensitive, binary)
*.xlsx
Banking transactions/

# Per-installation release/update config (see dashboard/release.config.example.json)
dashboard/release.config.json

# Local app data
.gl-data/
.gulliver-data/
gl-project.json
dashboard/server/data/

*.app